<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>Lineage 0 defeated. It expanded early and garrisoned thinly; both are what winning on the arena boards selects for.<\gray>
?else
<gray>Lineage 0 held. It reads the fleet in flight: an all-in launch lowered its threshold.<\gray>
?end
<blue>Log entry: lineage 1 was bred against lineage 0. It is in the queue.<\blue>
